      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ASTON FIXER (4) was prominent throughout when winning in the fastest time of the card two back but could manage only midfield last time when finished 5th and beaten 5.5 lengths at Ballarat (25.93). Has a strong record out of this box with two wins and two minor placings from five starts. Has ability and is a key runner. DISCOURAGED (6) is a talented type and proved too strong last time to win by 4.5 lengths at Warragul in a handy 26.05 beating Billy's View. Winner at his latest appearance in the quickest time on the card. Makes plenty of appeal if runs up to latest. ATHENS AURA (2) settled midfield in the run and boxed on to finish there when 5th (28.58) at Bendigo. Must be included in calculations. DUNDEE REX (8) cannot be left out despite racing here for the first time.",
